name=Numb Trait B42
poster=poster.png
id=NumbTrait_B42
description=[h1]Numb Trait[/h1]
description=
description=Adds a progression-based emotional hardening system tied to zombie kills.
description=Progression begins with the base game [b]Brave[/b] and [b]Desensitized[/b] traits and continues through five custom traits: [b]Hardened[/b], [b]Calloused[/b], [b]Detached[/b], [b]Apathetic[/b], and [b]Numb[/b].
description=
description=This mod is intended for players who want long-term psychological progression and reduced emotional penalties as their survivor adapts to the apocalypse.
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]What This Mod Does[/h2]
description=
description=This mod currently provides the following functionality:
description=
description=[list]
description=[*]Implements automatic trait progression based on total zombie kills:
description=[list]
description=[*][b]100 Zombie Kills[/b] – Automatically adds the [b]Brave[/b] trait
description=[*][b]500 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Brave with the [b]Desensitized[/b] trait
description=[*][b]900 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Desensitized with the [b]Hardened[/b] trait
description=[*][b]1300 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Hardened with the [b]Calloused[/b] trait
description=[*][b]1700 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Calloused with the [b]Detached[/b] trait
description=[*][b]2100 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Detached with the [b]Apathetic[/b] trait
description=[*][b]2500 Zombie Kills[/b] – Replaces Apathetic with the [b]Numb[/b] trait
description=
description=The above zombie kill counts are the default values.
description=[/list]
description=[/list]
description=
description=[list]
description=[*]The [b]Numb[/b] trait continuously clamps Panic, Stress, Boredom, and Unhappiness to 0
description=[*]All other custom traits affect Panic the same as the [b]Numb[/b] trait
description=[*]Stress, Unhappiness, and Boredom gain are progressively reduced as emotional detachment increases
description=[*]Hardened, Calloused, Detached, and Apathetic prevent stress and unhappiness gain from looting corpses
description=[/list]
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]Sandbox Options[/h2]
description=
description=Progression thresholds and emotional stat limits are configurable in Sandbox settings.
description=
description=[list]
description=[*]Enable or disable removal of the [b]Brave[/b] trait during progression
description=[*]Enable or disable removal of the [b]Smoker[/b] trait during progression
description=[*]Enable or disable the inclusion of the [b]Brave[/b] and [b]Desensitized[/b] traits in the progression
description=[*]Enable or disable any of the custom traits
description=[*]Customize the number of zombie kills required for each trait
description=[*]Set maximum allowed Stress for Hardened, Calloused, Detached, and Apathetic
description=[*]Set maximum allowed Unhappiness for Hardened, Calloused, Detached, and Apathetic
description=[*]Set maximum allowed Boredom for Hardened, Calloused, Detached, and Apathetic
description=[/list]
description=
description=Default values are provided but may be adjusted to suit different playstyles.
description=Discomfort will match the value for Unhappiness.
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]Mutually Exclusive Trait Handling[/h2]
description=
description=[list]
description=[*]Cowardly is removed when Brave is awarded
description=[*]Agoraphobic is removed when Brave is awarded
description=[*]Claustrophobic is removed when Brave is awarded
description=[*]Hemophobic is removed when Desensitized is awarded
description=[*]Smoker is removed when Numb is awarded
description=[/list]
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]Why Brave and Desensitized Are Included[/h2]
description=
description=The inclusion of the Brave and Desensitized traits in this mod is due to the following mods by Monkey being broken in the current build of Build 42:
description=
description=[list]
description=[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3388017161]Become Desensitized [B42][/url]
description=[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3388028737]Become Brave [B42][/url]
description=[/list]
description=
description=AND the following mods by Snakkos having no updates since December 2025 (and their Become Brave not having MP support):
description=
description=[list]
description=[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3628663440]Become Desensitized Unofficial [42.13 - MP Compatible][/url]
description=[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3628662124]Become Brave [42.13 Unofficial Fix][/url]
description=[/list]
description=
description=This mod includes its own implementation of Brave and Desensitized progression which does not function the same as the above mentioned mods.
description=
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]How It Works (Simple Explanation)[/h2]
description=
description=The mod continuously monitors the player’s emotional stats and zombie kill count.
description=
description=As the survivor kills more zombies, they gradually become emotionally hardened through a progression of traits:
description=
description=[list]
description=[*][b]Brave[/b] – Initial fear resistance gained through early combat experience.
description=[*][b]Desensitized[/b] – Panic is eliminated from all sources except nightmares.
description=[*][b]Hardened[/b] – Panic is eliminated. Maximum stress and unhappiness are reduced.
description=[*][b]Calloused[/b] – Further reduces the maximum stress and unhappiness the player can experience.
description=[*][b]Detached[/b] – Significantly reduces maximum stress and unhappiness. Boredom is now partially limited.
description=[*][b]Apathetic[/b] – Emotional response is heavily dulled. Stress, unhappiness, and boredom are greatly limited.
description=[*][b]Numb[/b] – Panic, stress, unhappiness, and boredom are permanently clamped to zero.
description=[/list]
description=
description=Each custom trait also prevents stress and unhappiness gain from stripping corpses.
description=Discomfort will be decreased equally with unhappiness for each custom trait.
description=
description=At the final stage, the [b]Numb[/b] trait fully suppresses Panic, Stress, Unhappiness, and Boredom.
description=
description=[hr][/hr]
description=
description=[h2]Planned Features[/h2]
description=
description=[list]
description=[*]Version 1.x.x 
description=[list]
description=[*]Include smell as part of the progression and reduced penalties.
description=[/list]
description=[/list]
description=[list]
description=[*]Version 2.x.x
description=[list]
description=[*]The entire trait progression will be restructured so that panic is not so quickly reduced to 0 and will have more of a progression like the other stats. In this restructure Desensitized will no longer be the second trait assigned (if Included via Sandbox settings).
description=[/list]
description=[/list]
description=
description=On the initial release of Version 2 there will be a new NumbTrait_B42_V2 Mod ID included which will correspond to v2 and the current NumbTrait_B42 will correspond to v1.
description=
description=[h2]Known Issues[/h2]
description=[list]
description=[*]Trait Icons need to be re-made or properly re-scaled/sized to better suit Project Zomboid UI requirements
description=[*]Stress gain from the Smoker Trait appears to ignore this mod's functionality
description=[/list]
